{"id":"H3929","lemma":"לֶ֫מֶךְ","transliteration":"lemekh","sayIt":"LE-mekh","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Lamech","meaning":"A man living at the time before the Flood, first mentioned at Gen.4.18;\nson of: Methushael (H4967); married to Adah (H5711) and Zillah (H6741);\nfather of: Jabal (H2989), Jubal (H3106), Tubal-cain (H8423), Naamah (H5279)\n§ Lamech = \"powerful\"\n1) the 5th lineal descendant from Cain, husband of Adah and Zillah, father of sons, Jabal, Jubal, and Tubal-cain, and daughter, Naamah\n2) father of Noah","glosses":["lamech","then lamech","when lamech","so lamech"],"count":10,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-4","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Lamech"}},{"chapterId":"gen-4","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"And Lamech","kjv":"And Lamech"}},{"chapterId":"gen-4","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Lamech","kjv":"And Lamech"}},{"chapterId":"gen-4","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"then Lamech","kjv":"truly Lamech"}},{"chapterId":"gen-5","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Lamech"}},{"chapterId":"gen-5","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"Lamech","kjv":"Lamech"}},{"chapterId":"gen-5","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"When Lamech","kjv":"And Lamech"}},{"chapterId":"gen-5","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"Lamech","kjv":"And Lamech"}},{"chapterId":"gen-5","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"So Lamech","kjv":"of Lamech"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"Lamech","kjv":"Lamech"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 4:18","note":"Irad was born to Enoch. Irad became the father of Mehujael. Mehujael became the father of Methushael. Methushael became the father of Lamech.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:3","note":"Enoch, Methuselah, Lamech,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H2989","lemma":"יָבָל","transliteration":"yaval","gloss":"Jabal"},{"id":"H3106","lemma":"יוּבָ֑ל","transliteration":"yuval","gloss":"Jubal"},{"id":"H4967","lemma":"מְתוּשָׁאֵל","transliteration":"metushael","gloss":"Methushael"},{"id":"H5711","lemma":"עָדָה","transliteration":"adah","gloss":"Adah"},{"id":"H674